- \Left panel of the editor: what page is open, what can be dropped on it, and
- \what is already there.
$bog_figmol_app_side $mol_view
	store $bog_figmol_store
	- \A site opened by somebody else's link keeps the lists and loses the palette
	editable true
	- \Middle of the viewport in sheet pixels, where a dropped block lands
	spot /number
	selected? \
	sub <= panels /$mol_view
	Pages $bog_figmol_app_pages
		store <= store
		editable <= editable true
		selected? <=> selected? \
	Blocks $bog_figmol_app_blocks
